*.local
# package-lock.json is deliberately NOT ignored. This connector deploys as
# a server holding the vault's GitHub token and the OAuth signing secret,
# so an unpinned tree meant every deploy re-resolved ~124 transitive
# packages with no diff to review and no reproducible build to compare a
# bad one against. The lockfile is the only thing that makes a dependency
# change visible in a pull request.
next-env.d.ts
tsconfig.tsbuildinfo
